    {
      "langue": "en",
      "text": "Tortorises is a port of the Konami/Stern arcade game, Turtles, released in 1981. It is a maze game where you're a mommy tortoise trying to save her kids, or kidtortoises. This game was released at the Cowlitz Gamers for Kids expo around April 2017."
